  "id": "diagnostic",
  "title": "3. Diagnostic Cheat Sheet",
  "useFor": "Use for: X dropped 20%, conversion declined, fraud increased, support contacts spiked, payments are failing, or customers are behaving unexpectedly.",
  "frameworkNote": "Verify → Segment → Hypothesize → Test → Act. Isolate the problem using evidence rather than brainstorming explanations indiscriminately.",
